     _l_o_a_d_d_e_v are set, and _L_I_N_E_S is set to 24.  Next, FICL is initialized, the
     builtin words are added to its vocabulary, and _/_b_o_o_t_/_b_o_o_t_._4_t_h is pro‐
     cessed if it exists.  No disk switching is possible while that file is
     being read.  The inner interpreter llooaaddeerr__44tthh will use with FICL is then
     set to iinntteerrpprreett, which is FICL's default.  After that, _/_b_o_o_t_/_l_o_a_d_e_r_._r_c
     is processed if available.  These files are processed through the iinncclluuddee
